# Gitignored files copied into each worktree Claude Code creates
# (claude --worktree / EnterWorktree). Same syntax as .gitignore; only files
# that BOTH match a pattern here AND are gitignored get copied. Each entry
# says why it is needed and what must change after the copy.
#
# MUST NOT list .claude/settings.local.json (or any local permission
# override): a copy would keep a permission alive inside the worktree after
# it is revoked in the main checkout — revocation never propagates to copies.
#
# MUST NOT list apps/web/supabase/.env: the local Supabase stack is shared
# across all worktrees (project_id and every port are fixed in the tracked
# supabase/config.toml, so per-worktree instances are impossible). Leaving
# the credentials out of worktrees keeps `supabase start` / `db reset` from
# being run there by accident — the stack is driven from the main checkout
# only. See .claude/skills/parallel-worktree/SKILL.md.
#
# apps/web/engines/ is deliberately absent too: it is symlinked from the
# main checkout via worktree.symlinkDirectories in .claude/settings.json
# (the Maia model inside is 46 MB and immutable), and copying into a
# symlinked directory would write through into the main checkout. The
# setting names engines/ rather than engines/maia/ because the symlinker
# links only into parent directories that already exist in the fresh
# checkout, and engines/ — wholly gitignored — is not created by checkout
# (verified 2026-08-25).

# Next.js dev/build reads the full env set from here. The database is SHARED
# with the main checkout (see above), so the connection strings stay as they
# are. The one value to adjust per worktree is NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL, when the
# dev server runs on a port other than 3000.
/apps/web/.env.local

# Engine binaries copied out of node_modules by `pnpm copy-stockfish` (the
# web prebuild runs it too). Regenerable after `pnpm install`, but copying
# the ready-made files spares every worktree that setup step.
/apps/web/public/stockfish.js
/apps/web/public/stockfish.wasm
/apps/mobile/assets/stockfish/stockfish.js.bin
/apps/mobile/assets/stockfish/stockfish.wasm
